// 2. Untargeted phase, $r=1..15$, loss $\in$ {CE, DLR, CW} cycled:
//    - $r=1$: clean init; $r\in[2,5]$: ODI init = $\mathrm{sign}(\nabla_x \langle w_r, f(x)\rangle\cdot \epsilon)$ with random $w_r$; else uniform-ε init.
//    - 50 PGD steps: $\alpha_t=\max(0.05\epsilon,\,\tfrac{0.75\epsilon}{2}(1+\cos\pi t/T))$.
//    - smoothed grad: average grad over $1+3$ Gaussian-noised copies ($\sigma=\epsilon/3$).
//    - $\ell_1$-mean normalize; momentum 0.75 then sign step + clip.
//    - update best_margin every 12 steps and at end.
// 3. Targeted phase ×2: for samples still correctly classified, take top-$k\le 15$ alt classes; for each target $\times 2$ restarts run 60 PGD steps with loss = $-\mathrm{CE}(f(x_t), t)$ (round 1) or $z_t-z_y$ (round 2), same momentum/cosine-α schedule.
// 4. return best_adv.

// 1. for restart $r=1..4$:
