//       iii. compute logits at $z$; $\mathcal{L}=\mathrm{CE}+2\,\mathbb{E}[\max_{j\ne y}f_j(z)-f_y(z)]$.
//       iv. grad $\to$ normalize by $\ell_1$ mean; $m\leftarrow 0.95\,m+\hat g$.
//       v. $x_{adv}\leftarrow\Pi_{\epsilon}(x_{adv}+\alpha_t\,\mathrm{sign}(m))$.
//    c. score restart by per-sample $\mathrm{CE}+2\,\mathrm{margin}$, update best_adv.
// 2. return best_adv.

